    {
      "text": "As soon as it spots others of its kind, Baltoy congregates with them and then begins crying noisily in unison. This Pokémon sleeps while cleverly balancing itself on its one foot.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Depictions of Pokémon similar to Baltoy have been found on the walls of caves where primitive humans lived.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "When they find others of their kind, they cry out loudly and gather together. Large numbers of them can be found in old graveyards.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
